SUMMARY:Palm Reading Class with Fairlight
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nPalm Reading Class for Healing\, Growth a
 nd Alignment\n“Are You a Channel?”\n[https://youtu.be/totjNeDWDD4?si=c
 9Yr4XPgpC5JU9fY](https://youtu.be/totjNeDWDD4?si=c9Yr4XPgpC5JU9fY)\nThis u
 nique approach to palm reading will teach you to identify:\n\n* psychic/sp
 iritual abilities\n* natural gifts\n* aspects of individual destiny\n* tra
 uma\n* challenges\n* energy blocks\n\nLearn ways to utilize this knowledge
  and understanding for personal growth and living your most authentic\, so
 vereign life.\nThis class will not teach you to predict the future\; rathe
 r to utilize knowledge of the present to make informed choices that will a
 lign you with your most desired timelines and destiny.\nDemonstration read
 ings will be presented throughout with in-person volunteers.\n\nQ & A sess
 ion will be at the end\, time permitting.\n\nTicket link for May 4th:\n[ht
 tps://calendly.com/airyfairytarot/palm-reading-class-for-healing-growth-an
 d-alignment](https://calendly.com/airyfairytarot/palm-reading-class-for-he
 aling-growth-and-alignment)
